OpenTTD (apps/openttd)

Engine (engine/)
  OpenTTD 15.3, by the OpenTTD team and contributors.
  License: GNU General Public License, version 2 (engine/COPYING.md).
  Source: https://github.com/OpenTTD/OpenTTD, tag 15.3 (commit
  14ec60f248547d4d062a1160f0fc26d742319888), with frunk.store's changes
  for the browser in engine/openttd-web.patch (also
  tools/openttd/openttd-web.patch in https://github.com/RobertPKyle/frunk-store,
  whose tools/build-openttd.mjs builds it with OpenTTD's own Emscripten
  Docker image, os/emscripten/Dockerfile). The complete patched source the
  build came from is engine/openttd-15.3-web-src.tar.gz.
  The changes: an ES module the page starts itself, a 1 MB stack, touches
  and the mouse handed in by the page (mouse events, moving the map, Ctrl
  and Shift held down), the size of the game set by the page, saving the
  game in progress from the page, and a music driver that hands each
  song's MIDI file to the page (midi.js plays it).

