  OpenSFX 1.0.3, by the OpenSFX team: base sounds.
    License: the sounds under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
    Unported, the other files under the GNU GPL 2 or later and the CDDL 1.1
    (data/opensfx-1.0.3/license.txt; credits in data/opensfx-1.0.3/readme.txt).
    Source: data/opensfx-1.0.3-source.tar.xz.
  OpenMSX 0.4.2, by the OpenMSX team: base music.
    License: GNU General Public License, version 2 (data/openmsx-0.4.2/license.txt).
    Source: data/openmsx-0.4.2-source.tar.xz.
  Each set's tar is gzipped here for downloading and unpacked by the page;
  it's otherwise unchanged from its release on cdn.openttd.org.

Online content
  The game's Online Content window downloads add-ons straight from
  OpenTTD's BaNaNaS service. They're made by their own authors under their
  own licenses; frunk.store doesn't host them.

